# GitHub Actions secrets for CD (Continuous Deployment)
#
# Add these in: GitHub repo → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository secret
#
# VERCEL_TOKEN=your_vercel_token_here
# VERCEL_ORG_ID=team_or_user_id_from_vercel
# VERCEL_PROJECT_ID=prj_xxxxxxxx
#
# How to get the values:
#   1. Create a token: https://vercel.com/account/tokens
#   2. Link the project locally: npx vercel link
#   3. Copy orgId and projectId from .vercel/project.json
#
# After adding secrets, push to main — CD runs automatically after CI passes.
